  "description": "Oppositely directed collinear addition: preserve the two standalone vectors and the offset tip-to-tail construction with its leftward outlined sum. Coordinates, equal copy lengths, horizontal regularization and stroke spacing are author-selected geometry, not measured scan givens. All small unlabelled ink endpoint markers are MODERN additions for visible inventory coverage, not source dots, source labels or numerical givens.",
